Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, God. Please.\N-Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bold plan, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this is the way to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-What does he remember?\N-Not a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He came in dehydrated\Nand disoriented...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...but once we gave him fluids\Nhe stabilized pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But l mean....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-He knows where he is?\N-Oh, yes, yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only the last day or so\Nthat seem to be missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on in. He's probably awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who l am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, son. I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here. Give your old man a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, l mean, in....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The past couple days are missing,\Nbut other than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...l feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a day this has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Uncle Hank,\Nhe was in a shootout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A shootout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed some guy.\NSome big drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Hank wasted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, my God. ls he all right?\N-Absolutely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where did this happen? How could--\N-Walt, everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And no idea what caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're gonna run\Na whole series of tests, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But what could it be? l mean, did they\Ngive you a worst-case scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I really....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, there's no point\Nin getting ahead of ourselves, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, which supermarket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it, like, a big one? Like, a chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Marie.\N-l.... Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's just great that, you know,\Nhe's back and he' s feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just, l mean....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He.... Naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In a supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Whole Foods, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, l'm gonna get over there\Nas soon as l can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Don't worry about it\Nright now, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I ran over here\Nand l got to see him all of...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...30 seconds\Nbefore they yanked him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you' d think today\Nof all days...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...they'd let him go home on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is he? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's indestructible, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I identified myself and told the suspect\Nto show his hands, turn and face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, I identified\Nthe suspect as Mr. Salamanca...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...and observed what appeared to be\Na gunshot wound in his midsection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-He was shot previous to your arrival?\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Again l instructed him\Nto show his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Salamanca lunged\Ntoward the vehicle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...and fired on me with what l\Nascertained to be an M1 6 assault rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I returned fire and sought cover...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...as Mr. Salamanca proceeded\Nto engage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When he paused to reload...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...l was able to take\Nan effective shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent Schrader...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...what were you doing in a shooting\Nfight on your own, with no backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Salamanca' s presence\Nwas not something I'd anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-l was tending to another matter.\N-What other matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An unrelated family matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for your brother-in-law,\Nas l understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your brother-in-law?\N-Yes, sir. He's since been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine. The whole thing\Nwas a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, he'd been missing\Nfor hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...and since he's in poor health,\Nthe whole family was concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking to his acquaintances...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...trying to get a fix\Non his whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Monte Carlo at the scene\Nbelonged to a former student of his...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...a Jesse Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was tracking down Mr. Pinkman's car\Nwhen l came across Mr. Salamanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about this Pinkman? What\Nwas his car doing at the crime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Have you run him down yet?\N-Not yet, but we're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, they're like\NJehovah' s Witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Why don't they\Nkick your door down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-They need probable cause.\N-Probable cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what did you do? Rob a bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, this is serious shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like an outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re Willy Wonka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Willy Wonka,\Nand l got the golden ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me on your magical boat, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail me down\Nyour chocolaty river of meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So where you keep the pseudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a P2P cook. That barrel?\NAqueous methylamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, you don't need pseudo.\NCome on, help me out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No pseudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to me, beautiful baby.\NI'm gonna be so good to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Just take this, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But l can't just let you\Nbreak this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-That'd be sacrilege.\N-l told you, that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-You saw the cops. Right?\N-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But couldn't we just\Ncook one quick batch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-You know, for the road?\N-No, forget it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-This stuff has to go, like, now.\N-Dude, you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're cool, but l ain' t\Nforgetting you just left me stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Badger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a bad choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally, totally cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yo, what' d we say, 500?\N-We didn't say, and it's 1 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand bucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, where you towing it,\Nman, Seattle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain' t the miles, it's the cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l mean, all I got on me is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...560.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-You know what?\N-Hey-- No--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Clovis, he'll pay you the rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally good for it.\NJesse's a stand-up dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-That right? You a stand-up dude?\N-Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get you the other 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your word' s your bond, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved your skinny ass, yo.\NI totally vouched for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing now, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you, like, two hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then I'm calling on a pay phone,\Nnot a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re not using your own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, obviously. Look, dude, l' ll do,\Nlike, what you said, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you gotta go and do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They need probable cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the last thing\Nyou remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l was driving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in, and l asked\Nwhy you were out of breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember talking to me\Nwhen l was in the bathtub?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, l don' t.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nothing else? No fleeting images?\N-Well, no. l....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was walking down some road\Nor highway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...with a lot of headlights...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l remember feeling fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's it.\N-All right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's definitely\Nsome good news here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The MRl shows no metastases.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning the cancer\Nhasn't spread to the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're looking really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what was it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's no sign of stroke or seizure.\N-And considering your condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...the blood panel looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we talking about?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As of right now, we really...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.\NGranted, this is not my field...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...but isn't it possible\Nthat this had something to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...with all the prescriptions\NI've been taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the antiemetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...the antitussive...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...the this, the that.\NNot to mention the chemo itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And being off all of them\Nfor the past few days, I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...l'm feeling much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and, you know, when we pick up\Nthese medications...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...the information sheets\Nare as long as your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's page after page\Nof side effects and warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, exactly.\NCould it be that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we' ll take\Nanother look at that, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, l understand that you've been\Nkind of stressed out lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stressed out? I--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, I don't think I'm--\N-Walt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stressed out is putting it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l guess I've had a lot\Non my mind lately, but as I've said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...l'm feeling much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be talking\Nabout when l can get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that may still be\Na ways down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A ways down the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think our next move\Nis to schedule a psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, is that absolutely necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes being in the hospital.\NI get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But until we know\Nwhat caused this incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...we can't be certain it won't recur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-That your last hit?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your hands.\NGet on your stomach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your stomach now!\NGet over. Roll! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going, l' m going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did l do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Pinkman, l presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-What, man?\N-Tell me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's there to tell, okay?\NHer and I were partying, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Saturday night?\NPartying for three days straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bumping uglies and smoking that\Ncrystal you got from your pal, Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Taco? l don' t know any Taco...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l damn sure didn't say\Nanything about no crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days,\Nyou must have got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-You order take-out?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You get yourself a little\Nof that moo goo gai pan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...from that chink place\Naround the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, we didn't. We got stuff\Nfrom the vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Funyuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a Hot Pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Funyuns and Hot Pockets?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice your car\Nwas gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not until you guys went\Nand busted down the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who's gonna pay for that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Management's gonna\Nbe on my ass for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:19:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-You weren't answering your phone.\N-lt was in my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-That right?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We found your car...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...but your phone wasn't in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You found my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome. DEA all the way. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're talking\Nabout missing property, did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you leave anything else\Nin the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what? Like....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-seven thousand, nine hundred\Nand 20 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it's not his, Gomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I really thought\Nthis might be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-l wish.\N-Unclaimed drug money, huh? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we got here,\NGomie, don' t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a new interdiction van\Nright there, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely new softball jerseys,\Nbecause we need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing Tuco's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost this kind of money,\NI'd wanna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So who' s your chief, little Injun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-What does that even mean?\N-l think your story' s bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know\Nwho Tuco Salamanca was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your car was there\Nbecause you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco had a bullet in him when l got\Nthere and you know about that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-With, like, a gun?\N-You?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only shooting you do\Nis into a Kleenex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But l think you know\Nthe badass who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l was partying with Wendy,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Funyuns and boom-boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what. We're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...go talk to that skinny yeast factory\Nof a girlfriend you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling she's gonna, you know,\Nroll on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my root beer? Come on.\NI gotta pee, and l got low blood sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-l got medical issues.\N-Medical issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, what kind of medical issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got penis withdrawal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got schlongus interruptus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, listen. Talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you get a root beer\Nand a tinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tell me the last three days.\N-l told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...we were shacked up since Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you left the room?\NNot even for a little, little minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For a second? l don't know, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jesse leave the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He did, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, you can do it.\NYou can do it, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, Wendy, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you wanna go back\Nto giving windys, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you. l know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re the one in the black truck.\NYou wanted me to do that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-The kid with the crutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-The football player.\N-How about we stay on topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Jesse came over to the palace\Nat 1 1 :00 Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We were together the whole time,\Nand he never left the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that' s all l'm saying about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my root beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted her to bang\Na football player, pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, Gomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is, and l wanna hear it,\Nbut first we gotta kick Pinkman loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. l got one more shot\Nat that little skid mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Most nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed\Nany recurring thoughts or images...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...things you can't\Nget out of your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How about feelings of guilt\Nor persecution?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Look, doctor,\NI don't mean to be rude...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...but where is this going, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re starting a process, Walt.\NAn ongoing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you prefer Walt or Walter?\N-Ongoing for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.12,0:23:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just met you. Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be talking about days,\Nweeks, months.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, doctor, l feel fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.13,0:24:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...if this is truly necessary,\Ncan' t I continue as an outpatient?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.97,0:24:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...a fugue state\Nis a very serious event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you were to disassociate\Nwhile driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.10,0:24:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get into a situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...where you could be shot\Nby the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't allow you to leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.40,0:24:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...until we're certain what happened\Nwas a non-recurring event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying you feel fine\Ndoesn't solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.45,0:24:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you tell me\Nabout patient confidentiality?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your permission,\NI can't disclose anything to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your family, not to the police.\NNot to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The exception would be\Nif you threatened to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then l'd be able to tell that person,\Nbut only that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.77,0:24:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, as a medical practitioner...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...you abide\Nby these strictures absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.44,0:25:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no fugue state.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...l couldn't stand to spend\Nanother second in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...and so I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.14,0:25:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about it.\NI just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I walked for a long time, and when I\Ncouldn't walk anymore, I hitchhiked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.77,0:25:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got as far as Gallup...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then it was just time\Nto come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.33,0:25:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:26:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...being found naked\Nin a supermarket...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...that was your way\Nof giving credibility to a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of avoiding questions\Nabout your disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you feel\Nyou had to run from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.90,0:26:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, my wife\Nis seven months pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.07,0:26:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...with a baby we didn't intend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My 1 5-year-old son\Nhas cerebral palsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.99,0:26:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an extremely overqualified\Nhigh school chemistry teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.54,0:26:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I can work,\NI make $43,700 per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.54,0:26:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have watched\Nall of my colleagues...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...and friends surpass me\Nin every way imaginable...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...and within 1 8 months,\NI will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.39,0:26:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And you ask why l ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomie, you wanna do the honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's that mean?\N-That means yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes is a bell, no is no bell.\N-Come on, this is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at this dude. He doesn't\Neven know what planet he's living on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.07,0:27:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.15,0:27:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...are we on the planet Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on the planet Saturn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.95,0:28:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on the planet Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.21,0:28:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, is today Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.84,0:28:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is today Monday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is today Tuesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, seems like he' s all there.\NLet's go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...was this man\Nat your house yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, was this man\Nat your house yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.00,0:28:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy right here,\Nhe was at your house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.13,0:28:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he doing business\Nwith your nephew Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, are you scared of this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna help us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.96,0:29:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.59,0:29:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.51,0:29:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-l told you, numbnuts. This guy' s OG.\N-Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.31,0:29:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kept his mouth shut for 1 7 years\Nin San Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stroke or no stroke, old-school\Ngangbang Mexicans don't help feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.94,0:29:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-All right. It was worth a try at least.\N-We gotta kick Pinkman loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.19,0:29:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. He's nobody anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You telling me you buy\Nthat lame-ass story?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.61,0:30:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I buy that lame-ass story more than\NI buy he had anything to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.11,0:30:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...with shooting Tuco, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad? Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.83,0:30:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.62,0:30:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, no, l'm fine. Hey, l'm....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's--?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.25,0:30:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She did?\NNo, I didn't get any messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.38,0:30:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...lost my phone, and l've been\Ntoo busy to get a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.30,0:30:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been busy as....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As totally productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.81,0:30:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what?\NI'm actually zeroing in on a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.31,0:30:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, data entry,\Nlike we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.81,0:30:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l'm totally amped.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you give me a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.07,0:30:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually--\NI'm downtown and my car's in the....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.\NYeah, hey, that's cool. I will--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you later\Nwhen you have some....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.00,0:30:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yeah. No. l--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.17,0:31:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.85,0:31:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.85,0:31:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.86,0:31:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Waffle House?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Waffle House is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.94,0:31:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.15,0:32:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay phone, in the middle of nowhere,\Nnobody followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.03,0:32:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.94,0:32:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.65,0:32:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They sweated me plenty,\Nbut they finally cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you getting out of there?\N-Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So who came for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.91,0:32:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The DEA? What did they ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.87,0:32:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the thing, you know.\NYour scumbag brother-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...took my rainy-day fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.25,0:32:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your what? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.26,0:32:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My rainy-day fund.\NSixty-eight thousand, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cue-ball son of a bitch\Nlaughed in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I got like 80 bucks\Nto my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.01,0:32:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. What does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.60,0:32:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he know it's your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.39,0:32:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man.\NHe doesn't know shit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.81,0:32:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bills due, man. l'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Did he mention my name?\N-No. Thanks for caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-What about the basement?\N-lt's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the RV?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.50,0:33:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger's cousin took it to his garage.\NIt's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he get it running again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.13,0:33:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-So we can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.97,0:33:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you still wanna cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's changed, Jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.65,0:33:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven-hundred thirty-seven thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-one pounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...minus cash on hand....
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.87,0:33:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.73,0:36:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry, honey. Did l wake you?\N-No, I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.15,0:36:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Want some cornflakes?\N-Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.54,0:36:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-You okay?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.54,0:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Southwest Aniline again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.00,0:38:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.21,0:38:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blue meth we found\Nup by your late homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.75,0:38:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco wasn't my homey, any more\Nthan Charlie Manson was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab says it got cooked, P2P-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.34,0:38:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,P2P, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The two stooges over here\Ncooked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.97,0:38:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab said that blue meth's\Nthe purest they' ve seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At least since this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.48,0:38:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Krazy-8.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:39:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8, Tuco....
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.70,0:39:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, some way,\Nit' s all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.78,0:39:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple explanation...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...only I' m not seeing it,\Nand it's making my head hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.00,0:39:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you're working\Nthat ugly melon too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dead around here.\NLet's get a couple of beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.54,0:39:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 1 1 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re buying? Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-What, is it Cinco de Mayo already?\N-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.43,0:39:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You little sneaky bastard, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.19,0:39:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.48,0:39:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.86,0:39:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's this?\N-Look what we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.28,0:39:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Look at that, l love it.\N-They got the gut right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.86,0:39:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.\N-There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.07,0:39:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, thanks, man.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.95,0:39:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got you a little something,\Nand this is from all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.71,0:40:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you sick, sick puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.35,0:40:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You going to finish\Nyour apple juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.60,0:40:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks, buddy. You take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.06,0:40:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re supposed to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.06,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The nurse said\Nyou have to stay hydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.07,0:40:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But l'm not thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.90,0:40:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad. Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.08,0:40:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.29,0:40:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better late than never, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.25,0:40:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.\N-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.34,0:40:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing, buddy?\NYou all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.26,0:40:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the mark of the beast there,\Nhuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.51,0:40:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.\NMarie stopped by this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.89,0:40:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They really cheer the place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.35,0:40:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I ran into Sky downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re rounding up a wheelchair\Nfor you, you freeloading bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.11,0:41:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell us about the shootout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.11,0:41:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was, you know, just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.66,0:41:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whole thing was over\Nin about five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.33,0:41:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Walt, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.45,0:41:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.91,0:41:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.37,0:41:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, l'm feeling fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.29,0:41:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?\N-Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.63,0:41:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor is calling it a....
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,An isolated episode of\Ntransient global amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.97,0:41:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.72,0:41:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means non-recurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.52,0:41:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-recurring.\NThat sounds good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.52,0:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, l'm glad you're back.\NYou really gave us a scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.40,0:41:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.15,0:41:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say. l mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.99,0:41:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...you going out there looking for me\Nput you in danger, and I'm so....
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.12,0:41:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry doesn't\Neven cut it. Not nearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.00,0:42:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Is that what you're\Nworried about? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.79,0:42:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the office, they're treating me\Nlike l'm Eliot Ness, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.42,0:42:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They threw me a party, the gals\Nbaked me a chocolate-chip cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...like you wouldn't believe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.13,0:42:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to disappear more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.51,0:42:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.64,0:42:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.\NLook what they gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.98,0:42:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what they gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.77,0:42:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.19,0:42:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That, gentlemen,\Nis the grill of the guy I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.69,0:42:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-His grill?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.32,0:42:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of goes over the front teeth\Nlike that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.11,0:42:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of a fashion statement, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.58,0:42:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, certain folks\Nare attracted to shiny things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.45,0:42:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.41,0:42:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.48,0:43:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how good it feels\Nto be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.45,0:43:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get these in the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.58,0:43:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.49,0:44:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, honey, l....
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.91,0:44:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about going out\Nto 7-Eleven. Do you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.88,0:44:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Gulp? Slim Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.48,0:44:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.36,0:44:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This will not happen again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.53,0:44:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.91,0:44:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still here. I'm me...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.49,0:44:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.88,0:44:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.51,0:44:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...do you have a second cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A second cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.47,0:45:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The night you disappeared, you came\Nin when l was taking a bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.85,0:45:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you were very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.81,0:45:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like something\Nterrible had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.94,0:45:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your cell phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you check the number,\Nand then you got up...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...and just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.66,0:45:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.33,0:45:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Hank\Nchecked your phone records...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.83,0:45:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...there was no call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.29,0:45:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No call on the phone l know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.43,0:45:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.89,0:45:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, l don't remember\Nany of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...but one thing I am sure of is that\NI don't have a second cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.23,0:45:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
